WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:14.806
♪♪

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:17.142
Merry Christmas, everyone. Love
you all!

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:20.103
-All the best, Nathan.
-Yeah, love you too, mate.
-Don't ever change, Nate.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:24.566
Oi! Before you go, I have one
more Christmas surprise for you.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.777
All:
It's Roy!
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:30.781
One of my presents
to Keeley is that I'd stop by
and say (bleep) Merry Christmas to you lot.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.532
So, Merry (bleep) Christmas.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.535
Ted:
Well, jingle my bells, it's Roy
Kent. 
-(Gasp)

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.704
What's the matter?
I got something on my face?

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:38.789
Rebecca:
No, Ted. That's the problem.

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:40.999
There's nothing on your face.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.626
Your mustache is gone.

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:45.003
Ahhhhh!

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:50.509
♪Yeah, it might be all that you
get♪

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:53.011
♪♪

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:58.976
♪Yeah, I guess this might well
be it♪

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:01.603
♪♪

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:05.565
♪And heaven knows I've tried♪

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:09.152
♪♪

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.529
Quick, anyone got a mirror?

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:12.364
Here you go, Coach. I've always
got a mirror.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:16.243
Oh, no. I'm supposed to
FaceTime with Henry in an
hour.

00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:18.453
He won't recognize me without my
mustache.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.705
It's gonna ruin Christmas.

00:01:19.705 --> 00:01:21.456
Don't worry, Ted. We're on it.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:24.459
Everyone, split up and find that
snot mop!

00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:29.506
♪♪

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:34.177
Boy, I hope they find it.
I really wanted this Christmas
to be perfect.

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:35.012
Higgins:
Sorry, Ted.

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:36.471
We looked everywhere.

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:38.807
Yes, I searched every inch of
the Royal Opera House.

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:40.183
It wasn't in Ted's car.

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:41.893
But I don't have a car, Jamie.

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:46.523
Then is wasn't in the person's
car whose window I just smashed
with a rock.

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:51.445
People, we don't need to find
Ted's mustache. We need to catch
it.

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:54.614
I built a trap and baited it
with a mustache's favorite
things:

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:58.076
crumbs, a small comb and a tiny
bit of pomade.

00:01:58.076 --> 00:01:59.745
Nate, that's a kill trap.

00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:03.415
You're damned right it is.
That thing escaped from Ted's
face,

00:02:03.415 --> 00:02:04.666
who knows what it wants next?

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:05.375
Keeley:
Wait!

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:07.961
Before we kill anything, let me
try something.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.171
(Wheels squeaking)

00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:10.380
(Zips)
(Lights pop on)

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:16.094
-Oh, little more up there.
-And a little just there and
presto!

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:18.013
Oh, I love it.

00:02:18.013 --> 00:02:20.432
I-I don't know, guys.
It's not really me, you know?

00:02:20.432 --> 00:02:22.642
Looks more more like Clark
Gable or John Waters.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:23.644
Allow me.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:27.314
Why do you have a disguise kit?

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:28.315
Why don't you?

00:02:31.193 --> 00:02:33.862
-That's amazing.
-Looks just like him.
-I think you look fantastic.

00:02:33.862 --> 00:02:36.990
Agree to agree, but the whole
point is for Henry to recognize
me.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.117
Right, forgot the objective.

00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:40.577
(Tears)
-Yowzer!

00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:42.996
Oi! You need a 'tache? Here.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.748
(Tearing)
(Grunting)

00:02:44.748 --> 00:02:45.499
(Bop)

00:02:45.499 --> 00:02:49.503
Whoa, I look like Detroit Tigers
super-fan, Magnum PI.

00:02:49.503 --> 00:02:53.673
But even though this feels like
I'm kissing your forehead,
it ain't me Roy.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.802
Oh babe, I'm gonna miss your
eyebrows.

00:02:56.802 --> 00:02:58.428
Hang on.

00:02:58.428 --> 00:03:00.806
(Gasp)
You're so hairy.

00:03:00.806 --> 00:03:01.932
Disgusting.

00:03:01.932 --> 00:03:06.603
Aye, it's no use. For the first
time in history, Tom Selleck has
ruined Christmas.

00:03:06.603 --> 00:03:07.646
I'll see y'all tomorrow.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.607
Where will he go? What will he
do?

00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:13.568
Frankly my dear, I don't give a
damn.

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:14.903
-Wow!
-Wow!
-Is that Clarke Gable?

00:03:14.903 --> 00:03:16.238
That is just right.

00:03:16.238 --> 00:03:20.283
Aww, thank you. Obviously I do
care, it's just the mustache
talking.

00:03:20.283 --> 00:03:23.161
♪♪

00:03:23.161 --> 00:03:25.288
(Chime)

00:03:25.288 --> 00:03:26.665
Keeley:
We love you, Ted.
(All greeting Ted)

00:03:26.665 --> 00:03:31.878
Hey guys, sorry I was being such
a straight, white, cisgender
male version of the Grinch earlier.

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:33.672
Which I guess is just Ebenezer
Scrooge.

00:03:33.672 --> 00:03:35.882
Rebecca:
Don't be silly, Ted.
Higgins: Oh, don't worry about that.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:39.636
Ted:
But I realized not having my
mustache, it ain't the end of the world.

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:42.556
'Cause it's not about making
Christmas perfect for the people
you love,

00:03:42.556 --> 00:03:44.724
it's the people you love that
make Christmas perfect.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:46.893
Higgins:
That is amazing, I can't believe
my eyes. 
Rebecca: Oh my gosh.

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.478
Uh-oh, what's wrong now?

00:03:48.478 --> 00:03:50.981
Keeley:
Your mustache is back.
-Hot dog, eggnog!

00:03:50.981 --> 00:03:52.107
(Chime)

00:03:52.107 --> 00:03:54.526
Uh-oh, that's Henry. I'll see
y'all later.

00:03:54.526 --> 00:03:56.653
All: Good luck, Ted! Bye!

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:59.364
Henry:
Merry Christmas, Dad.
You look great.

00:03:59.364 --> 00:04:03.201
Thanks, buddy. I actually just
shaved. 
You know what? One second big guy!

00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:05.662
Hey, everyone. Have a perfect
Christmas.

00:04:05.662 --> 00:04:10.167
I-I mean, an imperfect
Christmas. 'Cause it's the
imperfections that make it,

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:13.044
well, I mean you get it. You saw
what we're going for, right?

00:04:13.044 --> 00:04:17.048
Uh-oh! Is it snowing in my
apartment? Huh, that's weird.

00:04:17.048 --> 00:04:22.596
♪♪

